{"_comment": "Refugee arrivals and asylum grants, from the DHS Yearbook. REFUGEES AND ASYLEES ARE COUNTED AT DIFFERENT MOMENTS and are never summed here: a refugee is admitted from abroad after approval, an asylee is already in the country when the grant is made. REFUGEE ADMISSION IS A POLICY CEILING set each year by presidential determination, so the series tracks decisions in Washington rather than demand -- a fall is a policy choice and must not be read as fewer people seeking admission. Included so the employment and study routes elsewhere in this project can be read against the whole rather than in isolation; the legal basis, the caps and the process are entirely separate.", "source": "DHS Office of Homeland Security Statistics, Yearbook of Immigration Statistics, refugee and asylee tables", "source_url": "https://ohss.dhs.gov/topics/immigration/yearbook", "refugee_arrivals_by_year": {"1980": 207120, "1981": 159250, "1982": 98100, "1983": 61220, "1984": 70390, "1985": 67700, "1986": 62150, "1987": 64530, "1988": 76480, "1989": 107070, "1990": 122070, "1991": 113390, "1992": 115550, "1993": 114180, "1994": 111680, "1995": 98970, "1996": 75420, "1997": 69650, "1998": 76710, "1999": 85290, "2000": 72170, "2001": 68920, "2002": 26790, "2003": 28290, "2004": 52840, "2005": 53740, "2006": 41090, "2007": 48220, "2008": 60110, "2009": 74600, "2010": 73290, "2011": 56380, "2012": 58180, "2013": 69910, "2014": 69980, "2015": 69920, "2016": 84990, "2017": 53690, "2018": 22410, "2019": 29920, "2020": 11840, "2021": 11450, "2022": 25520, "2023": 60050}, "refugee_years_by_country": ["2014", "2015", "2016", "2017", "2018", "2019", "2020", "2021", "2022", "2023"], "refugee_top_nationalities": [{"country": "Congo, Democratic Republic", "arrivals": 18080}, {"country": "Syria", "arrivals": 10780}, {"country": "Afghanistan", "arrivals": 6590}, {"country": "Burma", "arrivals": 6130}, {"country": "Guatemala", "arrivals": 1760}, {"country": "Sudan", "arrivals": 1630}, {"country": "So